        {
          "name": "pqs:context",
          "value": "Changeable here. AES-256-CBC is the payload cipher of the WalletConnect v1 JSON-RPC bridge transport (CryptoSwift AES(key:blockMode:CBC)). The 'malleable unless a MAC is applied separately' caveat is met — the codec applies encrypt-then-MAC with HMAC-SHA256 over ciphertext+IV — but it is a hand-rolled AEAD instead of an authenticated mode like AES-GCM, and the tag is checked with non-constant-time == (see ALG-99c6681d). Symmetric primitive: not Shor-vulnerable; PQ relevance limited to Grover's 1"
        },
        {
          "name": "pqs:occurrences",
          "value": "1"
