        {
          "name": "pqs:context",
          "value": "Posture control on the WC v1 payload codec decode path: the HMAC-SHA256 tag over ciphertext+IV is verified with Swift's == on Data instead of a constant-time comparison, leaving a theoretical timing side channel on tag bytes. Fixable here with a constant-time compare. Not quantum-relevant — an implementation weakness in a symmetric protocol."
        },
